{"page":"MORF4L1","gene":"MORF4L1","accession":"Q9UBU8","protein":"Mortality factor 4-like protein 1","length":362,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"Q9UBU8-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000331268.9"],"refseq":["NM_206839.3"],"refseqProteins":["NP_996670.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q9UBU8-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q9UBU8-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":73,"plddt":[[0,1],[50,4],[70,5],[90,3],[70,1],[90,4],[70,8],[90,7],[70,7],[90,3],[70,4],[50,1],[0,43],[50,1],[70,2],[90,1],[70,1],[90,1],[70,1],[90,7],[70,1],[90,2],[70,13],[50,4],[0,45],[50,1],[0,10],[50,1],[0,2],[50,2],[0,5],[50,3],[70,3],[90,3],[70,1],[90,13],[70,2],[90,24],[70,3],[50,4],[70,5],[90,18],[70,1],[90,17],[70,1],[90,18],[70,18],[90,32],[70,4],[50,1]]}},"features":[{"type":"Domain","start":12,"end":51,"description":"Tudor-knot"},{"type":"Region","start":26,"end":62,"description":"Interaction with KAT8"},{"type":"Region","start":133,"end":266,"description":"Sufficient for interaction with SIN3A"},{"type":"Motif","start":135,"end":146,"description":"Nuclear localization signal"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":143,"end":143,"description":"N6-acetyllysine"},{"type":"Region","start":164,"end":230,"description":"Interaction with RB1-1"},{"type":"Region","start":188,"end":342,"description":"Sufficient for interaction with PHF12"},{"type":"Domain","start":191,"end":362,"description":"MRG"},{"type":"Region","start":323,"end":344,"description":"Interaction with RB1-2"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Component of the NuA4 histone acetyltransferase complex which contains the catalytic subunit KAT5/TIP60 and the subunits EP400, TRRAP/PAF400, BRD8/SMAP, EPC1, DMAP1/DNMAP1, RUVBL1/TIP49, RUVBL2, ING3, actin, ACTL6A/BAF53A, MORF4L1/MRG15, MORF4L2/MRGX, MRGBP, YEATS4/GAS41, VPS72/YL1 and MEAF6. The NuA4 complex interacts with MYC and the adenovirus E1A protein. MORF4L1 may also participate in the formation of NuA4 related complexes which lack the KAT5/TIP60 catalytic subunit, but which include the SWI/SNF related protein SRCAP. Component of the mSin3A histone deacetylase complex, which includes SIN3A, HDAC2, ARID4B, MORF4L1, RBBP4/RbAp48, and RBBP7/RbAp46 (PubMed:12391155, PubMed:14966270). May also interact with PHF12 and one or more as yet undefined members of the TLE (transducin-like enhancer of split) family of transcriptional repressors (PubMed:12391155). Component of the SIN3B complex, which includes SIN3B, HDAC2 or HDAC1, PHF12 and MORF4L1 (PubMed:21041482, PubMed:37137925). Interacts with RB1 and KAT8. Interacts with the N-terminus of MRFAP1. Found in a complex composed of MORF4L1, MRFAP1 and RB1. Interacts with the entire BRCA complex, which contains BRCA1, PALB2, BRCA2 and RAD51. Interacts with PALB2. Forms a complex with MSL1 and NUPR1"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q9UBU8-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":323,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000426013.7"],"refseq":["NM_006791.4"],"refseqProteins":["NP_006782.1"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,51],[53,92,271]],"edits":[{"start":52,"end":91,"original":"KSAVRPRRSEKSLKTHEDIVALFPVPEGAPSVHHPLLTSS","replacement":"N","added":1}],"missing":40,"replaced":0,"novel":1,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[[1,11,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q9UBU8-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q9UBU8-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":80.7,"plddt":[[0,1],[50,3],[70,4],[90,13],[70,2],[90,12],[70,4],[90,10],[70,1],[90,1],[70,1],[90,26],[70,7],[50,3],[0,1],[50,1],[0,52],[50,1],[0,3],[50,8],[70,3],[90,44],[70,11],[90,37],[70,1],[90,20],[70,12],[90,38],[70,3]],"losingConfidence":0}},{"accession":"Q9UBU8-3","name":"3","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":235,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000558502.5","ENST00000559345.5"],"refseq":["NM_001265603.2","NM_001265604.2","NM_001265605.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001252532.1",